<title>CANADA: Middlefield bids C$0.87/shr for H.E.R.O..</title>
<headline>Middlefield bids C$0.87/shr for H.E.R.O..</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Middlefield Group said Friday it intends to make an all-cash offer of C$0.87 per common share to purchase all common shares of H.E.R.O. Industries Ltd.</p>
<p>Middlefield said it anticipated that the offer would be mailed to shareholders shortly.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
